From e3e185b294e9ab651b0ac06dd79d176e1d3a985f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:55:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Sales dealer ledger access control (universal directory +
 check-in, gated ledger)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Splits what used to be one bundled gate (assigned_sales_rep, cascaded
through the Sales hierarchy) into two independent things, per Sumaksh's
spec: every Sales staff member now sees every dealer and can check in
anywhere (R1/R2), while the financial ledger (Overview/Ledger/Orders/
Insights) stays restricted to the owner, hierarchy-above, or an explicit
grant (R3) — grantable/revocable by Senior Sales Associate (scoped to
their own reports) and Senior Sales Executive (full override), multiple
grantees at once, via a new Team & Access screen. Adds a rejected-lead
duplicate-phone caution (R1a) and an in-app + email notification when
access is granted.

New: dealer_access_grants + staff_notifications tables, grant/revoke/
list RPCs, TeamAccess.jsx screen, NotificationBell.jsx, a Resend edge
function for the grant email. Rewrites get_my_dealers/get_dealer_detail/
get_dealer_orders/get_dealer_visits/start_dealer_visit/
check_duplicate_dealer_phone to the new visibility-vs-ledger split.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
